   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "\\mathcal{L}(\\phi) = \\mathbb{E}_{(s,a,r,s') \\sim D} \\left[ \\left( \\underbrace{r + \\gamma \\max_{a'} Q_{\\bar{\\phi}}(s', a')}_{\\text{TD Target}} - \\underbrace{Q_\\phi(s, a)}_{\\text{Prediction}} \\right)^2 \\right]\n",
    "$$\n",
    "- $\\bar\\phi$ 是目标网络 (Target Network) 的参数，用于稳定训练。"
   ]
  }
